seg-1e9c104231db = Galileo OSNMA receiver-side verifier

# text
seg-17fd702f5997 = A receiver-side verifier for Galileo Open Service Navigation Message Authentication (OSNMA), in pure Rust. It reads I/NAV pages and reports, per satellite and per epoch, whether the navigation data is cryptographically authenticated, and why a check failed.

# text
seg-ae081f55c4f1 = <b>Advisory.</b> This is analysis and monitoring output and not type-approved navigation equipment. The authentication status reported here is not a navigation integrity service and must not be the sole basis for any navigation or safety decision.

